Adaptation notice: this repository contains an independently organized Minecraft 1.17.1 compatibility implementation inspired by the original project's documented features. The 1.17.1 implementation uses older Yarn/Fabric APIs and vanilla particle substitutes where modern-only game content or APIs are unavailable. The original project and its author are not represented as endorsing this adaptation.

